changes.description:
Add the 2-entry fetch queue:
  - entries e0/e1 hold {instr, pc, pred_taken};
  - registered cnt_q with qv/full flops, plus syn_keep select replicas;
  - push/pop per the table in the hypothesis;
  - flush on redir_q.
The ID bundle is head-or-bypass: qv ? e0 : (imem_ready ? imem : NOP). Keep the redirect-first pc_d mux. New inputs: stall_id (ID accepts or not) and imem_ready. pc_ce = redir_q | (imem_ready & !full_q), so the PC is independent of the hazard/stall logic. Export the head's raw rs1/rs2 fields for the hazard unit.

